 {
  coords 558.728 138.135 4513.902
  m_sTitle "SITUATION"
  m_sTextData "<b>SITUATION</b>"\
  ""\
  "Our Retreating Damaged Armored Column is out of Fuel and requires maintainence, but Intel says Separatist forces could ambush us in the meantime while we wait for repairs, and the only reinforcments are 45 mins out."\
  ""\
  ""
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "RHS_USAF"
  }
  m_iOrder 1
 }
 {
  coords 649.757 134.116 4314.264
  m_sTitle "FRIENDLY FORCES"
  m_sTextData "<b>FRIENDLY FORCES</b>"\
  ""\
  "An infantry Rifle squad and an Infantry Weapons Squad on site, with an APACHE back at base."\
  ""\
  "The APACHE will need some time to take off, when it does you will be noted of it."\
  ""\
  "Vehicles in the Armored Column Are Inusable and <b>Cannot be entered</b>."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "RHS_USAF"
  }
  m_iOrder 2
 }
 {
  coords 805.184 138.688 4069.067
  m_sTitle "ENEMY FORCES"
  m_sTextData "<b>ENEMY FORCES</b>"\
  ""\
  "A Separatist Motorized Infantry platoon at [see map]."\
  "Exact size and power unknown."
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "RHS_USAF"
  }
  m_iOrder 3
 }
 {
  coords 440.796 137.475 3366.874
  m_sTitle "MISSION"
  m_sTextData "<b>MISSION</b>"\
  ""\
  "Dont let the Separatists destroy the Vehicles in the armored column, protect them until reinforcments come in 45 mins OR kill them all"
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "RHS_USAF"
  }
  m_iOrder 3
 }
 {
  coords 445.771 137.496 3359.341
  m_sTitle "MISSION NOTES"
  m_sTextData "<b>MISSION NOTES</b>"\
  ""\
  "US Defeat: Armored Column Fully Destroyed"\
  "US Victory: 45 Min Pass or All Separatists Killed"\
  ""\
  "APACHE: "\
  "Its Crew Can only start its Engine <b>3 mins after freeze time</b> which will be when <b>a text saying APACHEs Out pops up</b>."\
  ""\
  "COMMAND:"\
  "Rifle Squad SL Commands the Mission due to the PHQ being Busy rn"\
  ""\
  "Radio:"\
  "MHz 48: Command net"\
  "MHz 47: Rifle Squad net"\
  "MHz 47.5: Weapons Squad net"
  m_aVisibleForFactions {
   "RHS_USAF"
  }
  m_iOrder 3
 }
